Were all three prayers outside of hell, or was the first one in it?

You can't pray anywhere below the castle (except perhaps Vlad's; I don't
recall as I've never needed to pray below the castle.)  If you do pray in
hell, your god will get angry at you, and if you pray again (even once
you're back out) he'll get angrier.  So the first prayer angered him, and
the next 2 made him much angrier.

Did you try to convert any of the altars in Gehennom?  This is very bad as
well.  Talking to the priest (and even giving him money) is fine, but
offering stuff on altars is a very bad idea.

The best way to fix this is with an altar outside of hell and a lot of
fairly big monsters.  Don't pray until you're reconciled; you'll only make
it worse.

