As Bruce mentioned, bags don't just disappear -- especially not out of
your inventory (except in the case I mention below, or if you've found a
new bug.)  This is, of course, unless you pack them with one of the three
particular items that make them explode (which may, of course, be nested
within another item such as a sack.)  It's very likely you put one of
those items in there and didn't notice -- I've seen it happen to good
players, just not checking to see if there's a bad wand inside the sack
they just picked up.

Otherwise... think if there was anyplace you may have dropped it.  If you
ever polypiled, there's a chance that you dropped the bag in the pile and
turned it into a tin opener or something.  If you didn't, then it has to
be sitting somewhere, or else in some monster's inventory.  Look around
where you may have dropped it -- especially where you picked up the wand
of wishing.

